  {
    "path": "/about-us/",
    "title": "About Us – The 99",
    "headings": [
      "",
      "The 99 is a tribe of believers committed to living and sharing the Gospel in its purest form. Rooted in the parable of the lost sheep, where the shepherd leaves the 99 to find the one, our calling is to nurture, guide, and care for the 99 a community anchored in love, compassion, and trust. More than an organization, The 99 is a movement of transformed lives, creating a space where people belong, grow, and walk together in faith. It is a place where broken hearts are restored, purpose is rediscovered, and lives are shaped by grace and truth. We believe in doing life together supporting one another through challenges, celebrating victories, and constantly pointing each other back to Christ. At The 99, every voice matters, every story counts, and every individual has a role in building a stronger, faith-filled community. We are committed to discipleship, authentic relationships, and living out the teachings of Jesus not just in words, but in action. Our mission is to raise people who will carry the light of the Gospel into their homes, workplaces, and communities, becoming vessels of hope and transformation. Together, we are not just gathering we are growing, serving, and becoming all that God has called us to be.",
      "Our Value",
      "An incredible Team of great minds",
      "We are honored with amazing awards"
    ],
